path: /~keeper/index.html
role: flavor
---
<html>
<head><title>keeper's page</title></head>
<body bgcolor="#f5f0e1" text="#222222" link="#003366">
<h2>Mara Quinlan</h2>
<img src="grandpa.jpg" alt="my grandfather, Thomas Quinlan, on the gallery at Heceta Head, 1951" width="240">
<p>I live in Coos Bay with two cats and a Kenwood R-5000 that is older than both of them.</p>
<p>My grandfather Thomas kept the light at Heceta Head from 1946 to 1957. He kept a log every night, even on nights when nothing happened. <i>Especially</i> on nights when nothing happened. "If you only write down the interesting nights," he told me, "you'll end up believing the sea is more interesting than it is."</p>
<p>That's more or less the whole philosophy of this site.</p>
<p><a href="/">Back to the Lighthouse Network</a></p>
<!-- his logbooks are in the closet. someday i will type them all in. -->
</body>
</html>

