<html>
<head><title>Elias Ward - 2182</title></head>
<body bgcolor="#000000" text="#33ff33" link="#66ffff">
<center>
<h1>2182</h1>
<p>Elias Ward &middot; Tillamook, Oregon</p>
</center>
<p>I listen to maritime HF. Mostly the old distress and calling frequency, 2182 kHz, which nobody is required to watch anymore.</p>
<p>My <a href="gear.html">gear page</a> has what I use.</p>
<hr>
<h3>In memory of Robert J. Ward</h3>
<img src="dad.jpg" alt="Dad at the radio desk, Station Cape Sorrow, 1978" width="200">
<p>U.S. Coast Guard radioman, 1961&ndash;1989.<br>
Station Cape Sorrow, 1974&ndash;1981.<br>
Died February 11, 1999.</p>
<p>He taught me the phonetic alphabet before I could read. He kept every tape.</p>
<hr>
<p><a href="/">Lighthouse Network</a></p>
<!-- 73 dad. you were the best operator on the coast. -->
<!-- tapes: box 1-4 in the garage. box 3 = the cape sorrow drills, 77-79 -->
</body>
</html>

