@@@ home-junebug-lantern
type: html_page
title: THE LANTERN FILES
author: junebug
date: 1999-10-19T23:30:00-07:00
path: /~junebug/lantern.html
role: herring
---
<html>
<head><title>THE LANTERN FILES</title></head>
<body bgcolor="#000000" text="#00ff00">
<h1>THE LANTERN FILES</h1>
<p><b>UPDATED 10/19/99 - THE NETWORK IS DOWN. READ THIS.</b></p>
<p>Timeline (everything here I saw myself):</p>
<ul>
<li>Sept 3 - Eli records the voice at Cape Sorrow. "The light is out." Two numbers: four seven.</li>
<li>Sept 5 - nightjar hears it from Astoria. Independent confirmation!!</li>
<li>Sept 24 - Henrik, who had admin access in 1998, deletes ALL his posts and disappears.</li>
<li>Oct 15 - somebody downloads the WAV dozens of times in one day from a gateway I don't recognize. I saw it in the public stats page.</li>
<li>Oct 16 - the recording and every thread about it are deleted overnight.</li>
<li>Oct 17 - THE WHOLE SERVER GOES DOWN. Ray says "hardware".</li>
</ul>
<p>Four separate "accidents" in six weeks. The light is out. Somebody turned it off.</p>
<p>I have a copy of the WAV on a floppy. I'm not putting it online. Not yet.</p>
<!-- if something happens to me this page is the reason lol -->
</body>
</html>

